Package: linux-laptop-nut-bridge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, nut-server, nut-client
Description: Virtual Network UPS Tools (NUT) bridge for laptop batteries.
 Automatically translates internal ACPI battery capacity and line states
 into a dummy-ups device.
